&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The gig&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an analytics leader, you won&#39;t just provide data—you will actively shape the strategy of our financial services business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor a team of analysts to drive business outcomes and growth, using high-fidelity data to inform sustainable decision-making across our product ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end analytics function—designing the right team structure, hiring top talent, building capabilities, and setting an uncompromisingly high bar for problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with business and product leaders, acting as a translator who turns complex business challenges into clear, solvable analytical problem statements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower your team to generate holistic, unbiased analyses that directly influence product roadmaps and business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a data-driven culture across various functions, effectively influencing stakeholders and driving cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a core strategic partner within your pod, going far beyond a traditional analytics counterpart to actively co-create the business roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
