&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of relevant analytics experience, including a minimum of 2 years in a Product Analytics role, plus proven experience directly managing and developing a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency handling large-scale data and running complex analyses using SQL. You possess the data modeling skills necessary to understand data flows and manage ETL processes at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural curiosity for how products work under the hood, paired with a strong penchant for business strategy and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical with the ability to consistently apply the right frameworks and methodologies to solve ambiguous problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of dashboarding principles with hands-on experience building actionable dashboards (prior experience with QlikSense is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in FinTech, payments, or financial services. Statistical modeling experience using Python or R is also a great-to-have.&lt;/li&gt;
