&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;● Must be a graduate with at least 5&lt;br&gt;● 5+ years of experience in collections, with a minimum of 1-2 years in a team lead or supervisory role.&lt;br&gt;● Prior experience in a bank, new-age NBFC, or Fintech company is highly&amp;nbsp;preferred.&lt;br&gt;● Strong ability to lead and motivate a team.&lt;br&gt;● Excellent decision-making skills and the ability to work effectively under pressure.&lt;br&gt;● Proactive and effective communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
