&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DOES THIS ROLE EXIST?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At share.market, we’re building the future of intelligent trading &amp;amp; investing for India.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Finance can feel confusing. Broking can feel intimidating.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our mission is simple:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make finance clear &amp;amp; easy to understand&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make wealth creation accessible &amp;amp; provide intelligent insights to power your wealth creation journey&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is where you come in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who can be the face and voice of modern financial storytelling, someone who is equally comfortable in front of the camera and has a knack for financial research and written &amp;amp; visual storytelling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not just a content role.&lt;br&gt;This is not just a scriptwriting role.&lt;br&gt;This is a video first, creative marketing role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help us explain broking, trading, investing, fintech, capital markets in a way that builds trust and drives growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW YOU’LL SPEND YOUR TIME&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;50–60%: On Camera Content Featuring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
