&lt;p&gt;You’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Host financial education videos specifically around trading in capital markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present product explainers in a simplified manner&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create short-form and long-form content as per the marketing demands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build repeatable video series which scales and drives growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve delivery using performance data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don’t just “present.”&lt;br&gt;You hold attention. You build credibility. You simplify complexity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25–30%: Research &amp;amp; Scriptwriting (around trading in capital markets)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research trading, broking, markets, fintech trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write high-retention scripts with strong hooks especially around &lt;strong&gt;trading in capital markets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex financial topics into clear simplified stories for user consumption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with product &amp;amp; compliance teams to ensure accuracy. Shape narratives based on platform (YouTube ≠ Instagram)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;15–20%: AI-Powered Content Systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is not optional here. It’s core to the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use tools like ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Runway, Midjourney, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build prompt libraries for repeatable formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Repurpose long-form into short-form using AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test thumbnails, titles and hooks using AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build automated workflows (N8N, Zapier, Make, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify bottlenecks and design AI solutions&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are not just a user of AI. You build systems with it.&lt;/p&gt;
