&lt;p&gt;PhonePe is India’s leading fintech platform, deeply woven into the daily lives of over 700 million registered users. PhonePe Ads is capitalizing on this unprecedented scale, offering brands unique, deterministic audience targeting and high-intent commerce signals. With the addition of the &lt;strong&gt;Indus Appstore&lt;/strong&gt;, we are building a powerhouse multi-publisher ecosystem. Indus App&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an entrepreneurial, heavyweight&lt;strong&gt; Ads Leader to scale PhonePe Ads &lt;/strong&gt;and build the &lt;strong&gt;App Partnerships &amp;amp; Endemic Advertising for Indus Appstore&lt;/strong&gt;.This is a zero to one role with an existing large PnL mandate for the PhonePe Ads.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
