&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;About: PhonePe (phonepe.com) is the leader in UPI based payments in India with a market share of&amp;nbsp;more than 45%. Our goal is to make payments so easy, secure, and universally accepted that people&amp;nbsp;never feel the need to carry cash or cards again. We already are witnessing the mobile revolution, which&amp;nbsp;has changed the way we manage our money on the go. We see ourselves leading this change, through&amp;nbsp;technology and dogged customer centricity. PhonePe went live in 2016 and today, we have 500+ million&amp;nbsp;registered users - the first internet Indian company to do this and 35+ million merchants live on our&amp;nbsp;platform.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Objective&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role will develop and execute on the HR operations for the business by working&amp;nbsp;closely with stakeholders in the region.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Talent Acquisition &amp;amp; Onboarding:&lt;br&gt;● To ensure workforce requirements are in sync with annual operating plan and organization &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;operating structure from a perspective of layers, spans, etc.&lt;br&gt;● Work with talent acquisition partner to identify different available avenues for sourcing of right&amp;nbsp;talent.&lt;br&gt;● Review profiles, interview candidates and roll out offers with talent acquisition&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;● To execute the performance management process with regular touch bases and final evaluation&amp;nbsp;as per the decided timelines, for the assigned region&lt;br&gt;● Facilitate discussions of low performers with their managers and ensure creation of&amp;nbsp;performance improvement plan; Track achievement and take appropriate action in case of no&amp;nbsp;visible increase in performance level&lt;br&gt;● Drive organization health &amp;amp; manager connect surveys, as and when conducted, and ensure maximum coverage for the assigned region.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Business Partnering:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;● Maintain strong individual connect and regular touch points with all employees from the&amp;nbsp;assigned business groups&lt;br&gt;● Solve for front-line attrition by doing attrition analysis and taking corrective action&lt;br&gt;● Regular visit to sales offices in the regions and interact with the employees.&lt;br&gt;● Attend sales review meetings and market visits&lt;br&gt;● Own and interpret HR policy for the organization and resolve issues quickly and effectively.&amp;nbsp;Address all employee queries and provide help/ support within decided timelines&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capabilities &amp;amp; Requirements:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;● MBA - HR with working experience of 1-4 years&lt;br&gt;● Exposure to start up environment is an added advantage&lt;br&gt;● Understanding of HR concepts and evolving HR practices&lt;br&gt;● Strong on execution rigour for completing tasks with high ownership&lt;/p&gt;
