&lt;p&gt;We plan to expand our risk strategy team, and we are looking for a credit risk manager who will work on building risk strategies, risk models and risk policy implementation for our lending business. The person will work in a dynamic environment, and with cross-functional teams to help manage risk while continuously supporting the business to grow. They will be expected to work on:&lt;/p&gt;
