&lt;source src=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mkZstuTlMFTM8sDh1x4NYm7WSLueqklb/view?resourcekey&quot;&gt;&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-pdf_iframe__page&quot; data-page-number=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Network Delivery Engineer, you will be responsible for the execution of network provisioning tasks and 24/7 continuous monitoring, initial troubleshooting, and escalation of network infrastructure and service incidents. This role requires strong problem-solving skills, a foundational understanding of networking concepts, and the ability to work effectively under pressure in a fast-paced environment to ensure maximum network uptime and performance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience bucket: 1-3 years&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;●&lt;strong&gt; Handling BAU tasks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct network provisioning deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform Firewall configuration which includes ACL management, Periodic Firewall reviews and IPSec/NAT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform periodic Patch Management for Network switches/firewalls and servers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upgrade OS for network devices to maintain a stable environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undertake network maintenance activities during business off-peak hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;●&lt;strong&gt; Performance Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct performance analysis and implement optimizations to ensure the network operates at peak efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to fine-tune network parameters and troubleshoot performance bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● &lt;strong&gt;Network Automation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement automation scripts to streamline routine network tasks and enhance operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate automation tools and frameworks to support network provisioning, monitoring, and management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● &lt;strong&gt;Incident Response and Resolution:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a primary on-call engineer in resolving complex network incidents and outages and file RCAs wherever applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Function as L1 point of escalation for Network Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;●&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-pdf_iframe__page&quot; data-page-number=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;textLayer&quot; style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor Engineering&amp;nbsp; in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field, or equivalent work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-3 years of experience in network operations, network engineering or a related&amp;nbsp;role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity&amp;nbsp;with Data Center topologies and network routing and switching concepts like BGP, OSPF, VLAN, VRRP, etc. Knowledge of VxLAN will be an added advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic scripting and automation skills, with entry-level proficiency in languages like&amp;nbsp;Python, Go, Shell and orchestration tools like Ansible, Salt or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic fundamental knowledge of Linux esp. Distributions like Ubuntu and RHEL and web-servers like Nginx and Apache2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a 24x7 on-call rotation environment and in handling critical incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and troubleshooting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certifications/Course Completion for Cisco CCNA/Juniper JNCIA or equivalent&amp;nbsp;would be an added advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
