&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Team Structuring:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage, mentor, and scale a pod of 4-5 designers. Pivot effectively from individual contribution to strategic delegation—optimizing team structures, guiding career growth, and overseeing the quality of hires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Partner:&lt;/strong&gt; Build deep trust with business unit leadership. Operate as a &quot;first team&quot; with leaders by helping them achieve their functional goals through design. Proactively resolve conflicts and align stakeholders toward common objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build to Learn:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct intuitive product architecture with a strong “build to learn” mindset. Emphasize continuous prototyping, synthesize insights from usability testing, and weave them into the core product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Measurable Outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Define North Star metrics for your features and utilize data to form actionable insights. Ensure that design outputs directly influence business revenue and deliver measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holistic Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct the team to take a holistic view of the product ecosystem, employing journey maps and service blueprints to align stakeholders and improve end-to-end service delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
