&lt;p&gt;Building for Scale, Rapid Iterative Development and Customer-centric Product Thinking at each step defines every day for a developer at PhonePe. Though we engineer for a 50million+ strong user base, we code with every individual user in mind. While we are quick to adopt the latest in Engineering, we care utmost for security, stability, and automation. Apply if you want to experience the best combination of passionate application development and product-driven thinking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing accounts during integration&lt;br&gt;• Working with Products, Tech team and understand different product flow&lt;br&gt;• Attending meetings/con calls with Merchant&#39;s Tech/Business team&lt;br&gt;• Understanding Merchant&#39;s flow, requirements and suggesting the solution to them&lt;br&gt;• Researching, diagnosing, troubleshooting and identifying solutions to resolve the merchant integration Issue.&lt;br&gt;• Taking ownership of customer/merchant issues reported and seeing problems through to resolution&lt;br&gt;• Ask merchant the targeted questions to quickly understand the root of the problem&lt;br&gt;• Understanding Tech issues involved in integration &amp;amp; Providing resolution&lt;br&gt;• Automate the process to solve the merchant integration issue and merchant requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
