&lt;li&gt;Python and SQL - Required for this role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of any programming language (Ex: - PHP, JAVA, ASP.Net), platforms (Android, iOS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to diagnose and troubleshoot basic technical issues and to provide step-by-step technical help&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with remote desktop applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving, communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
