&lt;source src=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mkZstuTlMFTM8sDh1x4NYm7WSLueqklb/view?resourcekey&quot;&gt;&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Ad Sales Leader for Large Clients&lt;/strong&gt;, you will carry the P&amp;amp;L responsibility for driving ad revenue from India&#39;s largest brands in the Ecommerce, Retail, D2C, Food, Travel and AI sector. This is a foundational leadership role. You will not just manage a book of business; you will &lt;strong&gt;architect the zero-to-one setup&lt;/strong&gt; for new publisher surfaces (including the Indus Appstore), design scalable monetization strategies, and build a high-performing merchant/client partner team from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Revenue Ownership &amp;amp; Strategic Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;P&amp;amp;L Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and deliver the annual revenue mandate for large enterprise clients across assigned verticals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joint Business Planning (JBPs):&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and institutionalize strategic, long-term partnerships and JBPs with C-level executives and marketing heads of top-tier brands and media agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Publisher Monetization:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive ad adoption across both the PhonePe Consumer Payments App (high-intent transaction traffic) and the Indus Appstore (app discovery and distribution traffic) along with a suite of external publishers in the near-term&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Business Setup &amp;amp; Scaling (0 to 1)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-To-Market (GTM) Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define the value proposition, ad product positioning, and pricing strategies tailored for large enterprise clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with the Ad Product and Engineering teams to feed market insights back into the roadmap, helping build scalable ad tech solutions (branding, performance, and programmatic).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PhonePe Ads Penetration:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive larger share of digital marketing spends of top clients across both Brand &amp;amp; Performance marketing for Direct as well as Agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Relationships: &lt;/strong&gt;Build strong multi-tier relationships with CXOs across Direct &amp;amp; Agency base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Revenue Initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Scope &amp;amp; build new revenue opportunities that leverages the PhonePe groups strength&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Team Leadership &amp;amp; Capability Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Recruit, mentor, and retain a world-class team of Sales/Client Partners, and Account Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Foster a data-driven, consultative sales culture that focuses on solving client ROI challenges &amp;amp; be a client-growth partner rather than just selling inventory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profile Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10–12+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of total experience, with at least &lt;strong&gt;6–8 years of core digital ad sales experience&lt;/strong&gt; at large industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven track record&lt;/strong&gt; of managing large revenue portfolios (PnLs) and delivering consistent YoY growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;0-to-1 Build Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience in setting up ad monetization for a new publisher or launching a new business vertical/product line successfully.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Domain Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Landscape Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the Indian digital marketing ecosystem, including programmatic buying, data-driven targeting, attribution modeling, and app ecosystem dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vertical Rolodex:&lt;/strong&gt; Existing, strong relationships with CMOs, Brand Heads, and Media Agency leadership (GroupM, Publicis, IPG, etc.) across the Ecommerce, Retail, Food, and Travel sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
