ially Aerospike.&lt;br&gt;● Proficiency in Perl and Golang.&lt;br&gt;● Understanding of Galera cluster operations.&lt;br&gt;● Experience with data center related activities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PhonePe Full Time Employee Benefits (Not applicable for Intern or Contract Roles)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
