&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About PhonePe Limited:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in India, its flagship product, the PhonePe digital payments app, was launched in Aug 2016. As of April 2025, PhonePe has over 60 Crore (600 Million) registered users and a digital payments acceptance network spread across over 4 Crore (40+ million) merchants. PhonePe also processes over 33 Crore (330+ Million) transactions daily with an Annualized Total Payment Value (TPV) of over INR 150 lakh crore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PhonePe’s portfolio of businesses includes the distribution of financial products (Insurance,&amp;nbsp;Lending, and Wealth) as well as new consumer tech businesses (Pincode - hyperlocal e-commerce and Indus AppStore Localized App Store for the Android ecosystem) in India,&amp;nbsp;which are aligned with the company’s vision to offer every Indian an equal opportunity to&amp;nbsp;accelerate their progress by unlocking the flow of money and access to services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At PhonePe, we go the extra mile to make sure you can bring your best self to work, Everyday!. And that starts with creating the right environment for you. We empower people and trust them to do the right&amp;nbsp; thing. Here, you own your work from start to finish, right from day one. PhonePe-rs solve complex problems and execute quickly; often building frameworks from scratch. If you’re excited by the idea of building platforms that touch millions, ideating with some of&amp;nbsp; the best minds in the country and executing on your dreams with purpose and speed, join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;video controls=&quot;controls&quot; width=&quot;300&quot; height=&quot;150&quot;&gt;
&lt;source src=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mkZstuTlMFTM8sDh1x4NYm7WSLueqklb/view?resourcekey&quot;&gt;&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the packaging expert for our content. A world-class video is useless if no one clicks on it, and you are the person who ensures they do. Your job is to take the core hook of a video and turn it into a high-impact visual that stands out in a crowded feed. You will work in an AI-first environment, using generative tools to create assets and variations that would take hours to build by hand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Focus Area 1: Visual Storytelling and CTR Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You own the &quot;click.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You design thumbnails that tell a story in a split second. You understand how to use composition, contrast, and color theory to guide the viewer’s eye exactly where you want it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a master of &quot;The Hook.&quot; You know how to pair a compelling image with minimal text to create curiosity or urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You manage facial expressions and emotive triggers. You know how to select or generate the perfect &quot;hero&quot; image that connects with a human audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work closely with the Channel Intelligence Lead to analyze A/B test results and refine your designs based on actual performance data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Focus Area 2: AI-First Composition and Workflow&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You use the machine to outpace the competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a power user of generative AI tools like Midjourney, DALL-E 3, or Stable Diffusion to create unique assets, backgrounds, and characters from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use the latest AI features in Photoshop (like Generative Fill and Expand) to manipulate images, swap elements, and clean up compositions in seconds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build and maintain a library of AI-generated assets that allow us to move from a concept to a finished thumbnail in record time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay ahead of the curve. When a new AI model or technique drops that can improve our visual quality or speed, you are the first to master it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Focus Area 3: Iteration and Data-Driven Design&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t just make one version; you build a system for winning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You produce multiple variations for every video. You understand that the first idea isn&#39;t always the best, and you use AI to quickly test different angles, colors, and compositions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are obsessed with the &quot;why&quot; behind the click. You look at CTR (Click-Through Rate) data and qualified view metrics to understand which visual styles are resonating with our specific audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You ensure brand consistency. While every thumbnail is an experiment, you make sure the overall &quot;look&quot; of the channel remains premium and recognizable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Agility:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a master of the Adobe Suite and a power user of generative AI. You don&#39;t get hung up on tools; you use whatever gets the best result the fastest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention to Detail:&lt;/strong&gt; You have an eye for lighting, shadows, and perspective. You ensure that AI-generated elements blend perfectly into the final composition so they never look &quot;fake.&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speed without sacrificing quality:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive on high-volume output. You can turn around multiple high-end thumbnails in a single day without the quality ever dipping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t just &quot;feel&quot; that a design is good. You look at the data and can explain why a certain visual is likely to perform better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You treat the CTR of every video as your personal responsibility. If a video is underperforming, you are already building a new thumbnail before anyone asks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PhonePe Full Time Employee Benefits (Not applicable for Intern or Contract Roles)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insurance Benefits - &lt;/strong&gt;Medical Insurance, Critical Illness Insurance, Accidental Insurance, Life Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness Program -&lt;/strong&gt; Employee Assistance Program, Onsite Medical Center, Emergency Support System&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parental Support - &lt;/strong&gt;Maternity Benefit, Paternity Benefit Program, Adoption Assistance Program, Day-care Support Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobility Benefits - &lt;/strong&gt;Relocation benefits, Transfer Support Policy, Travel Policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retirement Benefits - &lt;/strong&gt;Employee PF Contribution, Flexible PF Contribution, Gratuity, NPS, Leave Encashment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other Benefits - &lt;/strong&gt;Higher Education Assistance, Car Lease, Salary Advance Policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our inclusive culture promotes individual expression, creativity, innovation, and achievement and in turn helps us better understand and serve our customers. We see ourselves as a place for intellectual curiosity,&amp;nbsp; ideas and debates, where diverse perspectives lead to deeper understanding and better quality results. PhonePe is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to treating all its employees and job applicants equally; regardless of&amp;nbsp; gender, sexual preference, religion, race, color or disability. If you have a disability or special need that requires assistance or reasonable accommodation, during the application and hiring process, including support for the interview or onboarding process, &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc-ETchy2LsQ_DjlNXOUcGfI182DnA533YZTLfVw5TkJH-Stw/viewform&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;please fill out this form.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Read more about PhonePe&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.phonepe.com/blog/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; on our blog&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.phonepe.com/blog/life-at-phonepe/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at PhonePe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.phonepe.com/press/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PhonePe in the news&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About PhonePe Limited:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in India, its flagship product, the PhonePe digital payments app, was launched in Aug 2016. As of April 2025, PhonePe has over 60 Crore (600 Million) registered users and a digital payments acceptance network spread across over 4 Crore (40+ million) merchants. PhonePe also processes over 33 Crore (330+ Million) transactions daily with an Annualized Total Payment Value (TPV) of over INR 150 lakh crore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PhonePe’s portfolio of businesses includes the distribution of financial products (Insurance,&amp;nbsp;Lending, and Wealth) as well as new consumer tech businesses (Pincode - hyperlocal e-commerce and Indus AppStore Localized App Store for the Android ecosystem) in India,&amp;nbsp;which are aligned with the company’s vision to offer every Indian an equal opportunity to&amp;nbsp;accelerate their progress by unlocking the flow of money and access to services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At PhonePe, we go the extra mile to make sure you can bring your best self to work, Everyday!. And that starts with creating the right environment for you. We empower people and trust them to do the right&amp;nbsp; thing. Here, you own your work from start to finish, right from day one. PhonePe-rs solve complex problems and execute quickly; often building frameworks from scratch. If you’re excited by the idea of building platforms that touch millions, ideating with some of&amp;nbsp; the best minds in the country and executing on your dreams with purpose and speed, join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;video controls=&quot;controls&quot; width=&quot;300&quot; height=&quot;150&quot;&gt;
&lt;source src=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mkZstuTlMFTM8sDh1x4NYm7WSLueqklb/view?resourcekey&quot;&gt;&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the algorithmic brain behind our highest-velocity financial property. This channel caters to active, serious investors focused on Futures and Options (F&amp;amp;O), technical analysis, and market momentum. Your job is to decode the trading community’s unique psychology and use platform data to scale our viewership. You understand open interest, option chains, chart literacy, and the analytical mindset required to navigate the markets. Operating in our AI-first factory, you will use data models and automated scraping to spot macro trends and derivative catalysts before they hit the retail feed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Focus Area 1: Derivative Market Trend Hunting &amp;amp; Catalyst Capture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t wait for traditional planning cycles. You move at the speed of the market ticker.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You monitor live market catalysts, open interest shifts, option chain data, and technical setups to identify breaking content opportunities within minutes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You translate complex technical analysis, derivative strategies, or macro announcements into high-impact, immediate concepts for our scriptwriters.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You run AI-powered social listening tools across financial platforms, specialized forums, and trading communities to catch retail sentiment shifts before they explode on YouTube.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You coordinate with the production team for rapid-response videos, ensuring we publish while market volume and volatility are still peaking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Focus Area 2: F&amp;amp;O Psychology &amp;amp; Advanced Retention Mechanics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You know exactly what makes a serious, active market participant click and watch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You optimize for the specific psychological triggers of the derivative community: risk management, position sizing, leverage, volatility, and the search for a definitive edge.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You design hook structures that establish immediate analytical authority, keeping viewers locked in through complex technical setups without losing pacing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You build a distinct packaging strategy for active trading content: utilizing clean chart patterns, clear data overlays, and high-intent thumbnail concepts that command attention on a crowded screen.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You guide the editing team on the pacing of technical breakdowns, ensuring that option strategies and chart analysis are snappy, visually engaging, and highly scannable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Focus Area 3: Algorithmic Agility &amp;amp; Real-Time Channel Management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You manage the channel like an active portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You monitor immediate velocity metrics: tracking click-through rates (CTR) and view-count acceleration within the critical first two hours of an upload.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You leverage YouTube Community posts, polls, and live alerts to keep the audience highly engaged around expiry days, market openings, and critical economic data releases.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You optimize live stream metrics, managing real-time engagement, interactive charts, and viewer retention during high-impact market hours.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You collaborate with the Creative Project Manager to dynamically pivot the content backlog based on daily market performance and viewer drop-off zones.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep Derivative Literacy: You possess a strong understanding of F&amp;amp;O mechanics, trading psychology, and technical analysis. You know how to read market depth, price action, and option Greeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data and Analytics Fluency: You can read a charting screen and a spreadsheet of audience analytics with equal comfort. You know how to extract actionable video concepts from raw platform metrics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Platform Mastery: 3 to 5 years of experience scaling hyper-engaged YouTube channels, specifically within the finance, equity markets, or active trading niches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Speed with High Precision: You thrive in high-pressure environments where getting an accurate, high-quality analysis out in two hours beats getting a perfect video out tomorrow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset to Succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Market-Driven: You love the energy of active markets. You see a sudden market correction or an expiry day surge as a high-value content opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Audience-Centric: You understand the active trader&#39;s risk tolerance and pain points. You know exactly how to structure titles and thumbnails that address their market concerns or validate their strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data-Obsessed: You do not guess what content works. You let the retention graphs, traffic sources, and performance data dictate the channel&#39;s next tactical move.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Automation-First: You embrace the automated factory. You are excited to use AI tools to scrape market indicators, generate title variations, and analyze competitor packaging instantly.&lt;/p&gt;
